vice | materials rendering and empty state | 6 |\\\\n154:## TC → Test Mapping\\\\n156:### `tests/service/client/process-router.test.ts`\\\\n170:### `tests/service/server/process-html-routes.test.ts`\\\\n184:### `tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts`\\\\n191:| `returns stable section error codes for history materials and side-work failures` | Client rendering and retries depend on machine-readable section error codes |\\\\n197:### `tests/service/server/process-actions-api.test.ts`\\\\n208:### `tests/service/server/process-live-updates.test.ts`\\\\n219:### `convex/processHistoryItems.test.ts`\\\\n229:### `convex/processSideWorkItems.test.ts`\\\\n238:### `convex/processOutputs.test.ts`\\\\n244:| `returns linkedArtifactId so materials builder can avoid duplicate current outputs` | Supports Epic 2 no-duplication rule between outputs and artifacts |\\\\n246:### `tests/service/client/process-work-surface-page.test.ts`\\\\n253:| TC-1.4a | `TC-1.4a renders history materials and side-work sections together` | Populated bootstrap | Mount page | All sections visible |\\\\n266:| TC-6.6b | `TC-6.6b page keeps rendering when materials section errors` | Materials envelope error | Mount page | Core page + healthy sections remain |\\\\n276:### `tests/service/client/process-history-section.test.ts`\\\\n286:### `tests/service/client/current-request-panel.test.ts`\\\\n298:### `tests/service/client/process-response-composer.test.ts`\\\\n306:### `tests/service/client/process-materials-section.test.ts`\\\\n310:| TC-4.1a | `TC-4.1a renders current materials alongside process work` | Ready materials envelope | Mount section | Artifacts/outputs visible |\\\\n311:| TC-4.1b | `TC-4.1b renders current source attachments when relevant` | Materials with sources | Mount section | Sources visible |\\\\n312:| TC-4.2a | `TC-4.2a shows artifact identity and revision context` | Artifact with version label | Mount section | Identity + revision visible |\\\\n313:| TC-4.2b | `TC-4.2b shows