edArchiveViews.ts:9-22, so the foundational archive tables no longer enforce the designed artifact/archive referential contract.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:682:          - \"convex/archiveTurns.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:683:          - \"convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:222:| Convex service tests | `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts`, `convex/archiveTurns.test.ts`, `convex/derivedArchiveViews.test.ts` | Durable append/read, sequence, idempotency, cached projections |\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:243:| Internal derivation helpers | No | Test via `TurnDerivationService` and `DerivedArchiveViewService` |\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:276:| TC-5.1a | `tests/service/server/derived-archive-view.test.ts` | `TC-5.1a derived view returned for turn range` | `turn_range` view returned without summary text |\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:302:| `tests/service/server/derived-archive-view.test.ts` | `chunk_candidate` rejects generated summary body content | Prevents summarization scope creep |\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:222:| Convex service tests | `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts`,